    "flavor_text": {
        "sun": "A single cry from this nocturnal Pokémon, and more than a hundred of its Murkrow cronies will assemble.",
        "moon": "If its Murkrow cronies fail to catch food for it, or if it feels they have betrayed it, it will hunt them down wherever they are and punish them.",
        "ultra-sun": "It will absolutely not forgive failure from or betrayal by its goons. It has no choice in this if it wants to maintain the order of the flock.",
        "ultra-moon": "Its goons take care of most of the fighting for it. The only time it dirties its own hands is in delivering a final blow to finish off an opponent."
